        <mxCell id="hdr" value="&lt;b&gt;Drones Controller — Complete End-to-End Autonomous Flight Pipeline&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Precision Geometric SO(3), Error-State EKF &amp;amp; DMDc Optimal Control Integrated with ArduPilot DDS SITL &amp;amp; Gazebo Harmonic" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;spacingLeft=15;">
