        <mxCell id="c5_hud" value="&lt;b&gt;💻 ArduHUD Dashboard (:8000)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Browser UI at http://localhost:8000&lt;br/&gt;• Three.js 3D attitude visualizer &amp;amp; gyro&lt;br/&gt;• 30 FPS MJPEG camera video stream&lt;br/&gt;• Live 8BitDo gamepad stick deflection HUD" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDFA;strokeColor=#0D9488;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;spacingLeft=8;">
