        <mxCell id="c5_sit" value="&lt;b&gt;🌐 ArduPilot SITL + Gazebo Harmonic&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Iris quadcopter multi-body dynamic model&lt;br/&gt;• Mixer matrix Γ maps [T; τ] → motor RPM&lt;br/&gt;• Motor thrusts: fi = kf Ωi² (propeller dynamics)&lt;br/&gt;• EKF3 sensor fusion (IMU, Baro, GPS, Mag)&lt;br/&gt;• AP_DDS micro-XRCE bridge feeds kinematics" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDFA;strokeColor=#0D9488;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;spacingLeft=8;">
