        <mxCell id="bot_use" value="&lt;b&gt;📍 WHERE IT IS USED &amp;amp; REAL-WORLD DEPLOYMENT PIPELINE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Autonomous Waypoint Tracking:&lt;/b&gt; High-precision 3D trajectory tracking in GPS / GPS-denied environments.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Controller Benchmarking:&lt;/b&gt; Direct comparative analysis between geometric SO(3) and data-driven DMDc optimal control.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Hardware Flight Stack:&lt;/b&gt; Companion computer (Jetson / RPi) connected to Pixhawk FCU running ArduPilot 4.5+ with FastRTPS DDS bridge." vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0D9488;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;spacingLeft=12;">
